# Baron Helmut Zemo: "fifteen or more black mana symbols among their mana costs" counts each Phyrexian {B/P} and each {2/B} hybrid
# symbol as one black mana symbol (CR 107.4e, 107.4f, 202.1): Dismember ({1}{B/P}{B/P}, mana value 3) has two, Kin-Tree Severance
# ({2/W}{2/B}{2/G}, mana value 6, white, black and green) one. Two Entombs put Doomsday Excruciator (6) and Pox Plague (5) into
# Bot1's graveyard; on turn 5 Zemo's connive discards Dismember and the third Entomb takes Kin-Tree Severance. The Excruciator, Pox
# Plague, Dismember and Kin-Tree Severance have fourteen symbols between them (though mana value 20), one short, and are refused;
# with an Entomb ({B}) they have exactly fifteen and are exiled. Bot1 casts none of the copies.

